    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for an U\u00b7N\u00b7F\u00b7A\u00b7U\u00b7L\u00b7T\u00b7E\u00b7D\u00b7T\u00b7Y\u00b7P\u00b7E NARRATIVE EXPERIENCE?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean a murder scene with a bleachgun as layers of the story unfold in nonlinear fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is the cleaner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is the boss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always remember...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...ITS NOT YOUR FAULT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detailed Features and Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic 64:25 aspect ratio (2.56:1)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic 24fps framerate cap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic camera angles and visual composition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-focused gameplay experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerwashing with a bleach gun in first-person view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring two locations at different times in third-person view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear story chronology</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>General Overview of Mature Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no actual violence <i>directly</i>\u00a0depicted in this game. However:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prior violent and or gruesome acts are a persistent contextual undertone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player powerwashes walls splattered with red-colored blood\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At one point, a non-playable character holds a gun to the player's head</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no sexual or drug-related imagery in this game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for an U\u00b7N\u00b7F\u00b7A\u00b7U\u00b7L\u00b7T\u00b7E\u00b7D\u00b7T\u00b7Y\u00b7P\u00b7E NARRATIVE EXPERIENCE?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean a murder scene with a bleachgun as layers of the story unfold in nonlinear fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is the cleaner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is the boss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always remember...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...ITS NOT YOUR FAULT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detailed Features and Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic 64:25 aspect ratio (2.56:1)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic 24fps framerate cap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic camera angles and visual composition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-focused gameplay experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerwashing with a bleach gun in first-person view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring two locations at different times in third-person view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear story chronology</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>General Overview of Mature Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no actual violence <i>directly</i>\u00a0depicted in this game. However:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prior violent and or gruesome acts are a persistent contextual undertone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player powerwashes walls splattered with red-colored blood\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At one point, a non-playable character holds a gun to the player's head</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no sexual or drug-related imagery in this game.</p>",
